    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36672" root="كثب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُثَابٌ</span></b>  <i>Many,</i> or <i>much:</i> (K:) a syn. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُبَابٌ</span>,
q. v.: you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعَمٌ كُثَابٌ</span>, meaning <i>Many camels,</i>
or <i>camels and sheep</i> or <i>goats.</i> (TA.)

